{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12232070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12232070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1223207001:0":{"text":"商品がちょっとなくなっただけだろ？そんな騒ぎ立てることかよ！","source_cn":"喂！不就是弄丢了你的东西吗？叫嚷什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x793A1DBCE5EF3DAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223207002:0":{"text":"みんな来てくれ！ギャングがまた理不尽なことを！","source_cn":"大家快来看啊，水鬼耍赖了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x783F257CB6F7CCA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223207003:1":{"text":"商品をなくして弁償しないばかりか、殴ると脅されてるんだ！","source_cn":"不仅弄丢了我的东西不赔钱，还威胁要打我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE206F2A501559D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223207004:1":{"text":"あり得ねぇ量の荷物を運ばせてたのは誰だよ？全部俺のせいだって言うのか！？","source_cn":"谁让你的东西那么多，来回搬来搬去，丢了能怪我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3148846E708DAE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223207005:1":{"text":"だ……黙れ！無駄口はいいから、さっさと払え！ブラッディ・マリーに言いつけるぞ！","source_cn":"你……你！少废话，赔钱！不然我就找血薇帮来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D0F96C1D5CD93D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223207006:1":{"text":"店主さん、悪かった。いくらだ？俺たちが払うよ。","source_cn":"老板别担心，你给个数，我们赔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9952689DD4369CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223207007:1":{"text":"金貨一万枚だ！早く払え！","source_cn":"一万金币！给钱吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AE2A790810F1153","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223207008:1":{"text":"あんた、そりゃ強盗だろ？二箱で一万金貨って、どんな高級果物だよ！？","source_cn":"你打劫呢？！两箱水果值这么多钱？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7FC33589D63C13C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1223207009:1":{"text":"商品代、機会損失、俺の精神的苦痛に対する損害賠償で一万金貨。これでも安いくらいだ！","source_cn":"货品损失费，误工费，以及我的心情损失费，一万金币，我还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7690F1991EBFC73D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223207010:1":{"text":"ちくしょう！俺のせいでそんな負債を抱えたんじゃ、仲間たちに顔向けできねぇよ！","source_cn":"妈的！老子今天要是给了这个钱，以后在兄弟们面前头都抬不起！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58D37D0B756403DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223207011:1":{"text":"そうだ！代わりに金歯に取り替えてやろうか？損はさせないぞ！",